wer\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Blightstaff.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Blightstaff.png/420px-Blightstaff.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"682\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Blightstaff.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>Before becoming a prized trophy for House Cannith, this twisted staff of broken branches was once wielded by a witch with unholy, dangerous powers of disease.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816211923\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.124 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.189 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6002/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 45620/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 15640/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  160.804      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  160.804      1 -total\n 96.90%  155.812      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 87.36%  140.477     75 Template:IO\n 30.36%   48.817      2 Template:Lamannia_p